		(uuid "539f8727-3feb-5e2f-809c-3852667efb0f")
	)
	(text "U21 ICM-45686 (TDK InvenSense DS-000577 Rev 1.0, Table 10 \"Signal Descriptions\" / Figure 4 pin-out, Single\nInterface SPI mode, Figure 10): AP_CS (pin 12) = ICM_CS, AP_SCLK (13) = ICM_SCK, AP_SDA/AP_SDIO/AP_SDI (14)\n= ICM_MOSI, AP_SDO/AP_AD0 (1) = ICM_MISO. INT1 (4) = ICM_INT1. INT2/FSYNC/CLKIN (9) = ICM_INT2 - typed\nbidirectional because FSYNC/CLKIN are host-driven inputs while INT2 is a chip output; only the INT2\nfunction is used here. VDD (8) and VDDIO (5) are both on V3V3_ANA; GND (6) is the only ground pin. Pins 2,\n3, 7, 10 and 11 (RESV) are all left No Connect: Table 10 allows No Connect / VDDIO / GND for every RESV\npin, and the Single-Interface SPI typical application schematic (Figure 10) shows all five left unterminated\n(internal pull enabled by default, per the per-pin notes in Table 10); they are only needed for the AUX1 or\nI2C-master dual-interface modes, neither of which this board uses. C50 (VDD) and C52 (VDDIO) are the 100 nF\nX7R of Table 11 \"Bill of Materials\" (C1/C2 in the datasheet) and are the WHOLE decoupling of this part: the\nBOM lists 0.1 uF per supply pin and nothing else, so the 1 uF C51/C53 this board used to add on top of them\nare removed. Table 11's own note - \"use a larger bypass capacitor than 0.1 uF if power supply ripple exceeds\n50 mV peak-to-peak\" - is the condition that would bring them back; V3V3_ANA is an LDO output, not a switcher."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 161.243 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "62a430f1-aff6-51f4-999f-9f30d1bd07d1")
	)
	(text "R48: 10k from ICM_CS to V3V3_ANA; R51: 10k from ADXL_CS to V3V3_ANA.\nCS pull-ups hold each sensor deselected during reset. No pulls on SPI clock/data.\nICM_INT1 and ICM_INT2 each have their own MCU GPIO, independent of all other sensors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 186.614 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "adfc0628-b5f5-55e0-929a-bfd00741b964")
	)
	(text "Test points: TP1 ICM_SCK, TP2 ICM_MOSI, TP3 ICM_MISO, TP4 ICM_CS;\nTP5 BARO_SDA, TP6 ADXL_CS; TP7 ICM_INT1, TP8 ICM_INT2,\nTP9 BARO_INT, TP10 ADXL_INT1. Keep probe stubs short.\nRouting priority: ICM SPI, ADXL SPI, native SD, then BMP581 I2C.\nUse a continuous ground reference; avoid switching nodes and long runs beside servo/pyro power."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160 143 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e46acb0e-f32a-59a9-9e5a-729a0dfbcc42")
	)
	(text "BOARD 2 - U21 ICM-45686: dedicated hardware SPI1. Powered from V3V3_ANA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f376ec32-5b48-519c-acbe-a4c16fcaf870")
	)
	(text "CS idle pull-up"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
